counterfactuals.output:
A coated article comprising:

a substrate; and

a coating disposed on the substrate, the coating comprising, by mass, from 20% to 83% zinc, from 2.5% to 46.5% aluminum, and at least 10% magnesium;

wherein a quasicrystalline phase constitutes from 30% to 60% of the coating by area;

wherein at least 90 number percent of particles present in the coating have a particle size of from 0.05 μm to 1.0 μm;

wherein the coating has a thickness of at least 0.1 μm; and

wherein an interface between the substrate and the coating has a thickness of not greater than 500 nm.
